  "details": "Udon output log messages are currently not assigned any prefix in the output log.\n\nThis makes it possible for a malicious Udon behavior to write messages in the format of VRChat log messages which can cause issues for applications that rely on the output log to gather information.\n\nTo prevent abuse in this form giving Udon log messages a prefix like the \"[UdonBehaviour]\" prefix which is already used for Udon exceptions would be appreciated.",
